ForwardModuleFactory_CreateDeterministic
├── when the salt is unused
│   ├── it should deploy a new ForwardModule contract
│   ├── it should deploy to the predicted address
│   ├── it should register the module in the factory
│   └── it should emit a ForwardModuleCreated event naming the deployer
├── when the same salt is reused
│   └── it should revert
├── when different salts are used
│   └── it should deploy to different addresses
├── when a different caller uses the same salt
│   └── it should deploy to the same address the first caller predicted
└── when fuzzing the salt
    └── it should match the deployed address
